{"id":"633095","name":"酱牛肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633095/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腱子肉","amount":"3000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量（没过牛肉即可）"},{"name":"山楂干","amount":"几块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉冷水浸泡出血水。","img":"images/633095/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/633095/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮锅放纯净水。","img":"images/633095/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放葱姜。","img":"images/633095/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放黄豆酱。","img":"images/633095/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/633095/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放花椒八角香叶。","img":"images/633095/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"牛肉煮锅，翻一翻肉块，外表全部煮变色。","img":"images/633095/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出洗净浮沫，放调料锅里。","img":"images/633095/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放几块山楂干。","img":"images/633095/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅和搅和。","img":"images/633095/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开，中火炖1小时放冰糖。","img":"images/633095/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放老抽。","img":"images/633095/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/633095/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再调下盐味。","img":"images/633095/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"小火再煮1小时即可。","img":"images/633095/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放鸡精提鲜。","img":"images/633095/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"取一块。","img":"images/633095/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/633095/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/633095/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"我煮的软烂，可以减少炖煮半小时时间。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}